0,Xamtanga language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xamtanga,"March 25, 2025 - In positions other than word-initial, Xamtanga contrasts geminate and non-geminate consonants. With most consonants, the difference between a geminate and a non-geminate is simply one of length, but the cases of /b t q/ are more complex.",Xamtanga,Afro-Asiatic
