9,Afro-Asiatic Languages - Sorosoro Sorosoro,https://www.sorosoro.org/en/afro-asiatic-languages/,"September 5, 2011 - Information concerning Afro-Asiatic Languages Where are Afro-Asiatic languages spoken? These languages are spoken in a vast trans-continental geographical area. In Africa, they are spoken across the North of the continent, from Ethiopia in the East to Mauritania in the West.",Xamtanga,Afro-Asiatic
